	   On a.WarehouseCode=b.WarehouseCode and a.BranchID=b.BranchID and a.compID=b.CompID
	Left Outer Join INV_WareHouseTemp_Master c
	   On a.WarehouseCode=c.WarehouseCode and a.BranchID=c.BranchID and a.CompID=c.CompID
